// yWeb language dictionary (server-side rendered)
// ------------------------------------------------
// Served through mod_yparser: every L: language token below is replaced
// with the translation for the active language (CLanguage chain: selected
// language -> Neutrino -> English). Beware: the parser replaces tokens
// even inside comments. Load this BEFORE yweb-header.js; ywebL(key, en)
// in yweb-header.js reads window.YWEB_L and falls back to its second
// argument when a key is missing or untranslated.
// Convention: modern-UI keys live under the yw.* prefix in
// data/y-web/languages/<Language>. Translation values must not contain
// double quotes.
